status GREEN for what this lap changed -- reds_ledger_monotone GREEN, reds_spine_derive GREEN, index_row_bound GREEN, pin and card under bound. stash_record and standing_equipment REMAIN RED at unlanded=3, deliberately: the row names why the gate has no lawful closing move here, and the move it does have is Keaton's cut.
recommend check-in (Claude) -- three stashes whose work the tree no longer needs want a word before anything drops them, and the alternative is a shape question rather than a lap: whether stash_record can tell a parked lap wanting recovery from one already superseded
